KNOWN COMPILATION ISSUES TO HANDLE PROACTIVELY
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Issue 1: tsfn lifetime in async move block
  ThreadsafeFunction must be moved into the async block.
  It implements Send so this is safe.
  If compiler complains about tsfn not living long enough:
