    RUNTIME.spawn(async move {
        // tsfn moved here
        tsfn.call(...);
        // tsfn dropped here — this is correct
    });

Issue 2: ThreadSafeCallContext import path
  In napi-rs 2.x the import path is:
    use napi::threadsafe_function::ThreadSafeCallContext;
  Not:
    use napi::ThreadSafeCallContext;
  Use the full path as shown in the imports section above.

Issue 3: into_unknown() method
  When adding JS values to the vec returned from the tsfn closure,
  each value must be converted to JsUnknown:
    Ok(vec![outer.into_unknown()])
  If into_unknown() is not available, use:
    Ok(vec![outer.coerce_to_object()?.into_unknown()])

Issue 4: ErrorStrategy import
  ErrorStrategy is in the threadsafe_function module:
    use napi::threadsafe_function::ErrorStrategy;
  Not at the napi root level.

Issue 5: napi-rs version differences
  If the project uses napi 2.x earlier than 2.14, the
  ThreadsafeFunction API may have slightly different method names.
  Check the napi crate version in Cargo.toml.
  If version is below 2.14, upgrade to 2.16 or latest 2.x:
    napi = { version = "2.16", features = ["async", "napi4"] }

